    "Measured on the preview's raw CCD values, before any correction. Left: the noise floor; right: clipping. Provisional thresholds, to be measured on the X1.": {
      "comment": "Tooltip of the exposure gauge",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Measured on the preview's raw CCD values, before any correction. Left: the noise floor; right: clipping. Provisional thresholds, to be measured on the X1."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mesurée sur les valeurs brutes du CCD de l'aperçu, avant toute correction. À gauche : le plancher de bruit ; à droite : l'écrêtage. Seuils provisoires, à mesurer sur le X1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show clipped and noise zones": {
